Description: Querencia Desktop icons and icon theme (alpha)
 Own icons of Querencia Desktop, a classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2:
  * program icons for the hicolor theme: Bilder, Dokumente, Editor,
    Einstellungen, Files, Lautstärke, Screenshot, Sitzung, Systemmonitor
    and Terminal;
  * the icon theme "Querencia" (places, devices, status, categories and
    applications in a flat GNOME 2 look, including the "show desktop"
    button and the icons of Archiv, Software, Dateisuche, Rechner and
    Kürzel), inheriting from gnome-human and hicolor.
 Every icon comes as SVG and as PNG in 16, 22, 24, 32, 64, 128 and 256
 pixels.
 .
 There is deliberately no 48x48 PNG next to the SVG: GTK 4.22 frees the
 window icon buffer twice for such icons and crashes when a window closes.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
